<p style="text-align: center;">Old Waterford Road. 9" x 12" oil on linen panel. 2014.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">A small landscape study that I finished last week. &nbsp;I took a few photos during a recent snowstorm and thought this scene would made a basis for an interesting painting. &nbsp;The trees were difficult to render without overdoing: as is often the case, less is more.</p>